# Fleetbreak Moorings - the third island of the library's plan The City That Never Sank (SL13, Highwater, chapter 3)
# The Free Fleet's harbour: a drowned office block whose roof went wild into a jungle garden, and round it a ring of
# ship hulks moored as a harbour wall, plank gangways between them. The Fleet's chart room stands on the biggest hulk's
# deck; Balboa-like vines close the stair up to the roof garden, where escaped boars root among mango and banana trees.
# Puffers drift in the moorings. Quest "The Free Fleet" (22 steps): the chart room, the Fleet's articles, the machete's
# plans, the vines and the roof garden, three boars, the fuel tank's and the fuel pipe's plans, Teo's log, the biofuel
# press, the Fleet's strongbox (goo, leather and a forged Authority pass), the contract offer. Contract "Filters Past
# the Boom" (5): the boom, three filter crates off the hulks, the Rookery's drop, the receipt, the reward (fleetfriend).
#
# Points: the roof garden 0 0 (a plateau about 7 m up, r about 18); the stair up its south face at 0 -19; the chart
# room x -3..3, z -41.5..-32.5 (deck 1 m); hulks round the ring at about r 44; the boom along z 46 from x -12 to 12;
# the Rookery's drop (a raft of foundations with a flag) at 40 -10.
include lib_sea
include lib_rt
include lib_huts
include lib_highwater
include lib_areas
include lib_features
# RESIZE 10-24b: Radius 36 -> 85 (Height 8 -> 8), the old content moved 0 -49 as one frame (push) so its sea side stays at
# DEEP 10-24: Mastback Fell: a forty-metre fell with the Fleet's signal mast, the flagship's deckhouse sunk at the moorings, and a foghorn that wakes the harbour.
# the coast; the island grows behind it. The ring of hulks, the boom and the Rookery's drop were moved out to the new coast as an arc of moorings (hulks south-east and south-west, the boom off the north shore, the drop in the north-east).
new
gen Trees=0.3 Bushes=0.3 Rocks=0.43 Harvest=0.3 BeachThings=0.25
gen Seed=13301 Radius=85 Height=8 Roughness=0.3 Peaks=1 Shape=0 Style=0 PeakShape=0.2 Cliffs=0.6 BeachWidth=0.3
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.2 SeaFinds=0.4 Sunken=0.3 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0.2 SeaLife=0.4
generate
push at 0 -49

