# --- Areas (10-24: every story island has places all over it and its quest crosses it): Gull Ridge in the north-west, the
# Fleet's crashed seaplane in the north-east, the harbourmaster's empty house in the west, the bosun's cave in the east
# (the hulk's gas tanks start the roof garden's old engine; the machete opens a vine cache on the ridge)
call ar_ridge x1=-46 z1=38 x2=-8 z2=62 h=12 top=6 r=9
